Patch prometheus_client to restore v0.21.1 parsing behavior to fix a performance regression introduced in v0.22.0, with up to ~40% improvement in check execution time for parsing-heavy workloads. This drops support for UTF-8 metric names, quoted dotted label names (OpenMetrics 2.0), and structural characters ({, }, =, ,) inside quoted label values. Set ``patch_prometheus_client`` to ``false`` in ``datadog.yaml`` to disable.
